<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab continues to test Kenya's border defenses with probe attacks, while militia violence near the Kenya-Ethiopia border killed eight people. Somali Danab commandos are conducting security operations along the Bay-Lower Shabelle border, and the Kenyan Defence Forces are preparing for chemical, biological, radiological and nuclear threats linked to al-Shabaab. Uganda has repeatedly denied reports that its troops were killed or attacked while withdrawing from Somalia. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQVUx4MTByNUE0YXJ5TXNIVHVtNTRxLUsyUmpJQ2U3RjNxYmdkRmc3VEFPRDlWTnd6U2RfV1Nkd2xwU2dxdi1KNjNucGhuMFlZUTFMWVRzeTZVYlJKQTBFMHFSODZZUGg0czgyOXhiTzFDMjc3LVgyLVFkX2FsZHRheFJLZGdaQS1PY3Z4VWZhclNqUE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOYlhYMGhhRGFKVlpJMkdtWWhwYi1IWXluSHpBeTdSVlFwQ090ajVTdUNpQXRiRU9adjBOSE9GSFFsOG9IZjZIU0JaRERfeFdJMlEzOGg3S3Y4aTRvRkZGSDh2UVBRekdnbHY4ZGY0Y19fSVl3TUhiNnpOa2QwZUpYMXNxQjZOTmc3akl6X202T0g1UlVBV3NQeHUxWWFvYXF2VEFyYlhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE4xd1dfWV9yd3NKZUsxMHZ1NWs2Tnh2dmlHZW9PMm1nVDhhR3R4QUYxNnA0ZzBBNlV5YzJFQXI3dUhSekpOV3B4QVpJaWMyRWNfcVV3VGxHMXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNSEJFUFN2ajNNRUpDYkhWaXRDdlB